t's very purposeful  everything that she says  has a purpose to it you know so  so um and and then when she goes into  like these  characters because she's a great bounty  hunter you know she knows how to lure  and like when she was getting um  omega's trust you know she changes her  energy just a little bit  she becomes more nurturing you know  she's very chameleon  in that way um seeing as we haven't seen  the last of fennec in the live action  uh how do you connect what we are seeing  in the bad batch to what we see later  do you try to connect the dots in your  head do they tell you  uh the road that your character is  taking or how do you  a little bit of both you know we go into  a lot of discussions  um about uh the character and the  motivations for any scenes  and uh and and that's what's so great  about john favreau and dave filoni  and robert rodriguez you know we we are  in extremely collaborative and they're  so supportive in listening to  my ideas and and incorporating them you  know if it's appropriate and if  if we disagree about something you know  we we talk it out  it's um it's so wonderful to work with  some  we're with people who just genuinely  want to tell the best story  in the most honest way possible and  and you know that's what they are  they're they're great collaborators  how do you change anything how you  approach fennec in uh  the book of boba fett based on how you  did her in the bad batch  yeah i think one of the things i could  give away is that  you know fennec has always been a loner  and she's always not need she didn't  want to  need anyone and i think when she was  taken by surprise  when toro cal callahan killed her  not really injured her badly um  like any anyone you know for me i feel  like there's a sense of  vulnerability now and what can she do  to better her odds and chances of  staying alive  and so her decision to now  partner up with boba fett not just so  much because of the honor system  which is there she does have a code of  honor and ethics  which i love um it's also you know not  about paying back a debt  it's also about okay this might be my  next  you know my my next uh um  adventure is to partner up with someone  uh based on where we uh see fennec again  now in the  the the newest episode of the bad batch  where do you  uh think her head is at what what is she  thinking when like all of these like  she's  getting trapped sort of in a way that's  way bigger than what you thought of  in the beginning well um  i mean i i can't answer that  you tried to trap me into a stop that  i'm not supposed to say  almost you almost got me raphael um  well i mean all i can say is you know  she  she's smart she'll you know she whatever  situation she gets herself especially  because she is young  younger and more reckless and more  ruthless in some ways  you know and and more ambitious  um it's it's you know  she's learning every every every  experience that she's  had up until that point will either  help her through it and we know she  survives because she shows up  20 some years later so um  yeah it's interesting it's interesting  to to see what  she how how quickly she learns and and  how she adapts  um how you finish recording the gremlins  animated series and is there any or is  there anything you can tease about that  project  um gremlins uh we're still in the  process of of working on it  yes yes it's it's that you that you love  about that franchise that made you want  to join  because i love the gremlins you know i  mean i loved all those  types of movies growing up and they're  classics  i just watched it again with my kids  because they've never seen it  and i'd forgotten how crazy that movie  was i mean you know when they put the  gremlin in the blender i was like  damn or in the microwave i was like  you know there was some viciousness  going on there  but um but you know it's great it's it's  fantastic classical  projects and it's stuff that i grew up  with and  so now to have a chance to um be a part  of  my childhood like who doesn't want that  um going to book above the future of the  mandalorian what is one thing that you  really hope to see or that you really  like about where the story is going  well first of all i get to work with  chamuera  who i absolutely adore he's just  the most charming talented funny guy  and yet i love our dynamics because he's  very serious in in certain ways and i'm  the geek and the nerd and whenever i get  on set i go  crazy for five minutes like looking at  everything touching everything asking  the crew  or the props people about this or that  or you know wanting to steal things off  the set i'm just like  and then tim's always the one that's  like me let's work  [Laughter]  so i love i love getting a chance to  work with him  and robert rodriguez too i mean such a  huge fan  um if i was a fan of his before i'm even  a bigger fan now  and then of course john and dave you  know it's it's about that  it's it's being surrounded by really  amazing  talented people and uh and getting to  just be in more star wars things  yeah awesome thank you so much me a  pleasure talking to you  pleasure talking to you too

